07031,7],["ἀναστὰς",701173,182],["ᾤχετο",709539,19],["καὶ",707031,7],["ἐφαύλισεν",713394,2],["Ησαυ",706030,4],["τὰ",709436,41],["πρωτοτόκια",711045,42]],"And Jacob gave bread to Esau, and pottage of lentiles; and he ate and drank, and he arose and departed; so Esau slighted his birthright."]]